  <item>
    <title>中文06 我独自生活X2</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f39ce869b6a485e8c13ecb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f39ce869b6a485e8c13ecb</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Sep 2024 05:17:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>两个女生，我们的20+的年纪里，真的很享受独自生活这个状态</span></p><span></span><p><span>能经济独立、情绪稳定地独自生活，在日复一日的时光里照顾好自己地身体、饮食、发肤、情绪，是机会难得的修行</span></p><span></span><p><span>真正的和自己相处的时光，终于自己喜欢什么、想要什么、想要往哪里走</span></p><span></span><p><span>不知道也没什么，再探索看看呢</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3063074391&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1210626578#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3063074391&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1210626578#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="106">01:46</a></span></a><span> 一个人生活，真的很爽</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3063074391&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1210626578#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3063074391&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1210626578#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="522">08:42</a></span></a><span> 4655自己一个人的时候会和粉丝要饭吃？</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3063074391&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1210626578#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3063074391&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1210626578#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="746">12:26</a></span></a><span> 米其林餐厅是王美的人生作弊器</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3063074391&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1210626578#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3063074391&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1210626578#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="994">16:34</a></span></a><span> 我们理解的所谓“向上社交”</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3063074391&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1210626578#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3063074391&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1210626578#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1681">28:01</a></span></a><span> 地理位置不是决定性因素，不在上海、多伦多这种大都市，也可以好好独自生活</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3063074391&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1210626578#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3063074391&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1210626578#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1987">33:07</a></span></a><span> 哪怕现在过很规律地朝九晚五生活，自己心里有一个声音说我不想这样</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3063074391&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1210626578#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3063074391&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1210626578#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2015">33:35</a></span></a><span> 自己一个人生活第一天是最难的，第二天是第二难的，第三天第三难的</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3063074391&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1210626578#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3063074391&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1210626578#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2315">38:35</a></span></a><span> 人要活得像老鼠/海鸥/鸽子</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3063074391&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1210626578#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3063074391&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1210626578#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2684">44:44</a></span></a><span> 王美的死亡笔记</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3063074391&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1210626578#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3063074391&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1210626578#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2863">47:43</a></span></a><span> 人在自己一个人的时候，会回归自己自然人的属性</span></p><span></span><p><span>你终于可以自己决定。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3063074391&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1210626578#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=3063074391&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=1210626578#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3602">1:00:02</a></span></a><span> 一个人的生活是西天取经，你可以决定你想去哪里，你也可以决定你要怎么去</span></p><span></span><p><span>（另外我要补充一下，播客里面没有讲清楚，我之所以会诅咒前男友是因为他在和我分手期间还和我聊天给我复合的希望，与此同时还和别的女生聊天，被我发现了。我当机立断手起刀落决定不再联系他，那段日子是靠着愤怒和恨意支撑下来的，有这段说明可能会更好理解一些，我不是因为不能承受分手，而是他两面开撩被我发现——王美）</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>抖音：@4566 @王美</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：@4566 @季音大王</span></p><span></span><p><span>weibo：@KYNGzzz @真是王美</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：其他女生（王美自己的号）</span></p>]]></description>
