    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Welcome to our first-ever English channel! Where we talk about everything and nothing at the same time, with you.</span></p><span></span><p><span>We were soooo nervous before recording this, but it gets better each time. After all, we have each side by side.</span></p><span></span><p><span>Also, we upgraded our mics, so please enjoy and share your thoughts with us!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> We are talking in English and we are SCARED.</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a> Judging is easy. Creating is hard.</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="379">06:19</a> Whipping/whooping 4566's ass.</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="441">07:21</a> 4566 solo singing break</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="528">08:48</a> ALLEGEDLY, JLO didn't sing any of her songs.</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="669">11:09</a> Chose your friend wisely</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="755">12:35</a> What are the differences between Tiktok and Podcast</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">13:15</a> It is bad for your mental health, but don't feel so guilty about scrolling</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a> How to get our attention back (a bit)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a> Refect, don't regret</span></p><span></span><p><span>--------------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>Tiktok @4566 @王美</span></p><span></span><p><span>Little Red Book @4566 @季音大王</span></p><span></span><p><span>Weibo @KYNGzzz @真是王美</span></p>]]></description>
